        defendant: [.direct("Why did you send those texts?", "\"We disagreed about what I was owed for the job. I was angry and wanted to get paid what I thought was fair.\""), .direct("What did you mean by 'it goes up'?", "\"I meant the video would go on my page as proof of how the job was going. I was bargaining.\""), .direct("Did you plan to post it?", "\"No. I never intended to post it. I wanted the client to settle the bill.\""), .direct("Why did you take the video?", "\"I recorded the work site to document progress, as many contractors do. I didn't mean it to be private.\""), .direct("What happened after you sent the text?", "\"The client didn't answer, then I heard from a deputy. I deleted nothing and told the deputy everything.\""), .direct("What would you tell the client?", "\"I'm sorry for the way I handled it. I'll let the bill go to the court and I won't threaten you again.\""), .cross("You had been in this courtroom before, hadn't you?", "\"Yes, and I should have known to use the courts, not texts.\""), .cross("You demanded two thousand dollars or the video would go up?", "\"I did, and I understand how that sounds. It was a mistake.\""), .cross("The video was private?", "\"It wasn't meant for sharing, and I shouldn't have used it as leverage.\""), .cross("You didn't ask a lawyer first?", "\"No, and I should have. I let my anger make the decision.\""), .cross("You'll delete the video?", "\"Yes, right away, and I won't use anything like it against the client again.\"")],
